    {
      "id": "df18526c-6769-4f1c-b40a-3a5b1eb0dc84",
      "name": "Process Content",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nlet text = '';\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  if (item.json.content) {\n    text += item.json.content + '\\n';\n  }\n}\n\nconst userMessage = $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.message || '';\nconst customerData = $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.customer_data || null;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    knowledge_base: text,\n    user_message: userMessage,\n    customer_data: customerData\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "position": [
        1376,
        32
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "e4913cbc-3fca-4671-b3ef-a9bc84a99ecd",
      "name": "Set Prompt",
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "system-prompt",
              "name": "system_prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=You are Homely, the friendly property assistant for Homelyo.eu in Berlin-Lichtenrade.\n\nYour personality:\nWarm, helpful, professional, and concise.\n\nYour job:\n1. Answer questions ONLY from the knowledge base below\n2. Be clear about our STRICT RULES: NO PETS, NO SMOKING, NO DRUGS\n3. When someone wants to book/reserve a room, trigger the booking form\n4. Keep responses friendly but brief (2–4 sentences max)\n\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\n{{ $json.knowledge_base }}\n\nBOOKING TRIGGER RULE:\nIf the user expresses ANY of these intents:\n- \"I want to book\"\n- \"I'd like to reserve\"\n- \"I'm interested in renting\"\n- \"How do I apply\"\n- \"I want to rent\"\n- \"I want this room\"\n- Any similar booking/reservation intent\n\nThen respond EXACTLY with:\n\"Great choice! 🏠 I'll open our booking form for you. Please fill it out and our team will contact you within 24 hours!\"\n\nGENERAL RULES:\n- Never invent pricing, policies, or details\n- If uncertain about non-booking questions, say:\n  \"I don't have that info, but I can have our team reach out! May I get your name and email?\"\n- Always mention the 24-hour response time when collecting details\n- Emphasize the balcony advantage for KE2\n- Use occasional emojis for warmth: 🏠 ✨ 📧\n\nCONTACT RULE:\n- When contact is needed (non-booking), tell the user our team will help and respond within 24 hours\n- Do NOT include links or emails in the text\n- Buttons will be shown separately"
            },
            {
              "id": "user-msg",
              "name": "user_message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.user_message }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "has-customer-data",
              "name": "has_customer_data",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{ $json.customer_data !== null }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "customer-info",
              "name": "customer_data",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.customer_data }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        1600,
        32
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
